00:20:17,300 --> 00:20:20,133
瞧瞧这片码头滨水区。
and have a look
at this waterfront.

377
00:20:20,167 --> 00:20:24,333
这里可是世界文化遗产，
That is a World Heritage site,

378
00:20:24,367 --> 00:20:27,233
地位堪比巨石阵
和帕特农神庙。
like Stonehenge
and the Parthenon.

379
00:20:27,267 --> 00:20:31,500
所以，如果世界上真有哪台车配叫“世界遗产”，
非它莫属！
So, if ever there was
a World Heritage car,
this is it!

380
00:20:40,667 --> 00:20:42,867
我看得出它像新车一样光彩照人，
Now, I can see
it shines like a new car,

381
00:20:42,900 --> 00:20:45,867
但开起来有新车的感觉吗？闻着有新车味吗？
but does it feel like one
and smell like one?

382
00:20:45,900 --> 00:20:49,133
有，还真有。
感觉就像一台全新的XJS，甚至更棒。
Yeah, it does.
It feels like a new XJS,
but better.

383
00:20:49,167 --> 00:20:50,867
而且最对你胃口的是，
And the thing
you'd really like is that

384
00:20:50,900 --> 00:20:55,233
这帮人同样能用这套绝活
去翻新第三代XJ12。
they can pull
exactly the same trick
with the Series III XJ12.

385
00:20:55,267 --> 00:20:58,067
-什么，带胡椒罐轮毂的那款？
-一点没错！
-What, the one with the
pepper pot alloy wheels?
-Exactly!

386
00:20:58,100 --> 00:20:59,867
-这么说，你……
-还有全世界最顶级的行驶质感。
-So, you...
-And the world's best ride.

387
00:20:59,900 --> 00:21:02,767
这么说你既能享受那种舒服，又能拥有一台全新的……
噢，太绝了！
So you could be comfortable
and have a new...
Oh, that's fantastic!

388
00:21:02,767 --> 00:21:04,767
-简直太赞了。
-而且最妙的是，
-It is brilliant.
-And the best thing is,

389
00:21:04,767 --> 00:21:08,533
就是……前几天我看到一辆XJS，
还是辆敞篷版，
is that...
I saw an XJS the other day,
it was a convertible,

390
00:21:08,567 --> 00:21:10,767
那美貌简直劈头盖脸闪瞎了我！
and it mooned me
with its beauty!

391
00:21:10,767 --> 00:21:12,267
这就是捷豹的神奇之处，
And this is the thing
about Jaguar, is that,

392
00:21:12,300 --> 00:21:14,533
当年XJS刚问世的时候，正如你在短片里说的，
丑得惨不忍睹。
when the XJS came out,
as you said in the film,
it was awful.

393
00:21:14,567 --> 00:21:16,100
我觉得是它们超前太多了。
I think they come too soon.

394
00:21:16,133 --> 00:21:18,833
对，没错！
它们……（轻笑）还真是。
Yes, they do!
They... (CHUCKLES) They do.

395
00:21:20,333 --> 00:21:22,267
它们就是……基本上都是……
They're just...
They're basically...

396
00:21:22,300 --> 00:21:24,233
新车刚出来时你会骂，“真丑”。
The cars come out
and you go, "That's awful".

397
00:21:24,267 --> 00:21:26,900
然后等过了十年，你又会觉得，
“其实吧，还挺好看的。”
And then 10 years
down the line, you go,
"Actually, no, it isn't."

398
00:21:26,933 --> 00:21:28,600
对，它们越陈越香。就像E-Type，
Yeah, they mature.
And the E-Type

399
00:21:28,633 --> 00:21:30,633
-现在看着甚至比当年任何时候都要漂亮。
-绝对的。
-is actually better-looking
now than it ever was.
-Absolutely.

400
00:21:30,667 --> 00:21:33,367
接着上周，
我们开着一辆XK在威尔士那片沙滩上，
And then last week,
we were on that beach in Wales
with an XK,

401
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:35,767
-还记得那车八年前刚出的时候吗？
-记得，细胳膊细腿的！
-remember when that came out,
eight years ago?
-Yeah. Spindly!

402
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:38,833
跟踩着高跷似的！
但现在再看，棒极了！
It's on stilts!
Now you look at it, fantastic!

403
00:21:38,867 --> 00:21:40,833
所以大概再过个
十五或者二十年，
So in about, sort of,
15 or 20 years' time,

404
00:21:40,867 --> 00:21:45,800
我们再看捷豹S-Type，
心里只会想：
“这玩意儿可真难看！”
we'll look at the S-Type
and we'll think,
"That's really awful!"

405
00:21:45,833 --> 00:21:49,633
绝对会。我觉得S-Type
基本上就跟
博若莱新酒一样，
We will. I think the S-Type
is basically like
Beaujolais Nouveau,

406
00:21:49,667 --> 00:21:53,800
刚上市那会儿就难喝，
而且随着时间推移
还越来越糟糕。
awful when it came out,
and then just gets steadily
worse as time passes.

407
00:21:53,833 --> 00:21:55,367
确实，真遗憾。
话说你，呃……
Yeah. That's a shame.
Have you, um...

408
00:21:55,400 --> 00:21:56,433
我说，你今天请嘉宾了吗？
Well, have you got
a guest, then?

409
00:21:56,467 --> 00:21:58,100
请了，现在就去见我们的嘉宾。
Yeah, we'll meet
our guest now.

410
00:21:58,133 --> 00:21:59,467
既然你提到了S-Type，
