and he's
a broadcasting colossus,
there's no other word.

412
00:22:02,400 --> 00:22:05,867
他早年在银行打工，
而如今，毫无疑问，
Started out working in a bank,
and he is now, without doubt,

413
00:22:05,900 --> 00:22:08,667
是整个乐坛最具影响力的人物。
the most influential man
in music.

414
00:22:08,767 --> 00:22:10,933
女士们先生们，
特里·沃根！
Ladies and gentlemen,
Terry Wogan!

415
00:22:10,967 --> 00:22:13,067
（掌声与欢呼声）
(APPLAUSE AND CHEERING)

416
00:22:17,767 --> 00:22:19,300
最近身体怎么样？
How are you?

417
00:22:19,333 --> 00:22:22,067
-快请坐。
-还能怎么样，凑合活着呗。
-Grab a seat.
-As well as can be expected.

418
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:27,200
我现在算……
面色苍白，但意志坚定。
I'm sort of...
I'm pale, but determined.

419
00:22:27,233 --> 00:22:29,367
面色苍白、意志坚定，外加一条瘸腿，
Pale but determined,
and also with a gammy leg,

420
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:32,633
但依然能左右唱片销量。
but still able to influence
the sale of records.

421
00:22:32,667 --> 00:22:34,833
这纯属江湖传闻。
This is a popular myth.

422
00:22:34,867 --> 00:22:36,533
我可没有，你看……
I don't, you know...

423
00:22:36,567 --> 00:22:39,933
