估摸也就八百万人收听吧。
I get about...
I suppose eight million people
listen of a morn.

424
00:22:39,967 --> 00:22:41,633
比全世界任何人都多！
More than anyone else
in the world!

425
00:22:41,667 --> 00:22:44,633
可大清早的他们还能听啥呢？
But what else
