I'm like a dirty old
rug in the kitchen.

430
00:22:57,567 --> 00:22:59,633
根本没人真正在听我说什么。
Nobody ever really listens
to what I'm saying.

431
00:22:59,667 --> 00:23:01,300
话虽如此，
我可得驳你一句，
Nevertheless,
I can fight back on that,

432
00:23:01,333 --> 00:23:04,633
因为我昨晚刚给一位
在索尼上班的朋友打了电话，
because I rang
a friend of mine
last night who works for Sony,

433
00:23:04,667 --> 00:23:08,533
他说基本上只要你
在节目里推一首“本周单曲”并放出来，
who said, basically,
if you plug a record
of the week and play it,

434
00:23:08,567 --> 00:23:09,833
那就彻底稳红了！
home and dry!

435
00:23:09,867 --> 00:23:13,133
你能捧红一个艺人，
