with his waxed chest!

444
00:23:39,467 --> 00:23:41,767
你能替我办成这事吗？
如果我求求你呢？
Could you do that for me?
If I said, "Pretty please"?

445
00:23:41,800 --> 00:23:43,467
我能为你做的事可多了去了，
There's many a thing
I would do for you,

446
00:23:43,500 --> 00:23:46,200
但彼得·安德鲁
可是我私底下
非常非常铁的挚友。
but Peter Andre
is a very, very dear
personal friend of mine.

447
00:23:46,233 --> 00:23:47,533
（笑声）
(LAUGHTER)

448
00:23:47,567 --> 00:23:49,800
我怎么一听就觉得
