No, I never talk about that.

451
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,633
（观众笑声）
(AUDIENCE LAUGHS)

452
00:23:55,667 --> 00:23:58,333
不幸的是，我聊！呃……
Unfortunately, I do! Um...

453
00:23:58,367 --> 00:24:00,767
你说那比赛有黑幕。
You said it was corrupt.

454
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:03,233
倒也没真这么说。
我当时说的是……
I didn't, really.
What I said...

455
00:24:03,267 --> 00:24:07,100
不过我也没说
