What surprises me
about your views
on the Eurovision Song Contest

464
00:24:35,667 --> 00:24:37,800
你居然还会
对此感到惊讶。
is that you're
surprised by this.

465
00:24:38,333 --> 00:24:39,667
我……
I...

466
00:24:39,767 --> 00:24:41,267
因为你想想嘛，
'Cause we have, you know,

