908
00:45:11,333 --> 00:45:13,500
具体的运作过程是这样的。
Here's how the process works.

909
00:45:14,733 --> 00:45:16,533
奶牛拉了一坨屎。
The cow does a poo.

910
00:45:18,333 --> 00:45:23,033
把这坨屎铲起来，
倒进一个叫作发酵罐的专用罐体里。
The poo is scooped up
and put into a special tank
called a digester.

911
00:45:23,067 --> 00:45:24,633
这玩意儿有点像酿酒设备，
It's a bit like a brewing kit,

912
00:45:24,667 --> 00:45:30,000
它会把大便转化成堆肥，
用来播撒到田间地头。
and it turns the poo
into compost
for spreading on fields.

913
00:45:30,033 --> 00:45:34,367
在发酵罐里的时候，
这些大便会产生大量甲烷气体。
Whilst it's in the digester,
the poo generates
lots of methane gas.

914
00:45:34,400 --> 00:45:38,933
通常情况下，这个过程产生的甲烷
全都被白白浪费掉了。
And normally, the methane
given off by this process
goes to waste.

915
00:45:38,967 --> 00:45:39,967
但今天不行。
But not today.

916
00:45:42,033 --> 00:45:45,267
我们要把气体收集起来，
输送进这台压缩机，
We're keeping the gas
and feeding it
into this compressor

917
00:45:45,300 --> 00:45:47,567
它会对其压缩以增加密度，
which squashes it
to make it more dense

918
00:45:47,600 --> 00:45:50,433
好让它能装进汽车的气罐里。
so that it will fit
into a car tank.

